copy-db-credentials="cpDatabaseCredentialsText">Copy credentials</button><p class="form-note">Privora does not store the plaintext password. You can set or reset it later from this database list.</p></article><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATABASE ACTIVITY</span><h3>Running sessions for your databases</h3></div><div class="inline-actions"><select id="cpDatabaseActivityEngine"><option value="mariadb">MariaDB</option><option value="mysql">MySQL</option><option value="postgresql">PostgreSQL</option></select><button class="ghost" id="cpRefreshDatabaseActivity" type="button">Refresh</button></div></div><div id="cpDatabaseActivityTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading sessions…</div></div></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="email">
  <div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Email Accounts</h1><p>Manage mailboxes without keeping the creation form open all the time.</p></div></div>
  <div class="mail-overview customer-mail-overview" aria-label="Email overview"><div><strong id="cpMailCount">0</strong><span>Mailboxes</span></div><div><strong id="cpMailDomainCount">0</strong><span>Domains</span></div><div><strong id="cpForwarderCount">0</strong><span>Forwarders</span></div></div>
  <details class="panel-card mail-compose customer-mail-compose"><summary><span>+ Create email account</span><small>Open account form</small></summary><form class="quick-form mail-compose-form" id="cpMailboxCreateForm" data-customer-create="customer-mailbox-create"><label>Email address<div class="mail-address-builder"><input name="local_part" required maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" placeholder="hello" aria-label="Email account name"><span>@</span><select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required aria-label="Email domain"></select></div><small>Choose from domains already created in this hosting account.</small></label><div class="field-grid"><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><label>Confirm password<input name="password_confirm" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required></label></div><div class="inline-form-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost" data-mail-password-generate="customer-create">Generate strong password</button></div><label>Mailbox quota (MB)<input name="quota_mb" type="number" min="100" max="102400" value="2048" required></label><p class="form-note">The password is sent only to mail provisioning and is not stored by Privora in plaintext.</p><div class="mail-form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Create account</button></div></form></details>
  <article class="panel-card mail-list-card mail-primary-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Email accounts</h3><small>Edit quota or password, or remove an account.</small></div><span class="badge" id="cpMailListBadge">LIVE</span></div><div id="cpMailTable" class="data-table"></div></article>
  <article class="panel-card mail-setup-card" id="cpMailSetupCard" hidden><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">CLIENT SETTINGS</span><h3>Email account setup</h3></div><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpMailSetupCopy">Copy settings</button></div><pre id="cpMailSetupText"></pre><p class="form-note">Use the full email address as the username. IMAP/POP use SSL/TLS; SMTP supports port 465 SSL/TLS or port 587 STARTTLS.</p></article><div class="split-page v7-workbench"><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">TRACK DELIVERY</span><h3>Email delivery history</h3></div><form id="cpMailDeliverySearch" class="inline-actions"><input name="query" placeholder="recipient or sender"><button class="ghost">Search</button></form></div><div id="cpMailDeliveryTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading recent delivery events…</div></div></article><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL FILTERS</span><h3>Mailbox rules</h3></div></div><form id="cpMailFilterForm" class="quick-form"><input type="hidden" name="id"><label>Mailbox<select name="address" id="cpMailFilterAddress" required></select></label><label>Rule name<input name="name" required placeholder="Invoices"></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Field<select name="field"><option value="from">From</option><option value="to">To</option><option value="subject">Subject</option></select></label><label>Match<select name="operator"><option value="contains">Contains</option><option value="is">Is exactly</option><option value="matches">Wildcard</option></select></label></div><label>Value<input name="value" required></label><label>Action<select name="action"><option value="fileinto">Move to folder</option><option value="redirect">Forward</option><option value="discard">Discard</option><option value="keep">Keep</option></select></label><label>Destination<input name="destination" placeholder="Folder or forwarding address"></label><button class="primary">Save & compile rule</button></form><div id="cpMailFiltersTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading filters…</div></div></article></div>
</section><section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="dns"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>Zone Editor</h1><p>Create and inspect DNS zones for your websites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-dns-create"><h3>Create zone</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="zone-available" required></select><small>Choose one of your existing domains that does not already have a DNS zone.</small></label><label class="check"><input name="dnssec" type="checkbox"> Enable DNSSEC</label><button class="primary">Create zone</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpDnsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DYNAMIC DNS</span><h3>Token-authenticated address updates</h3></div><span class="status-pill active">DNS.WRITE SCOPED</span></div><p>Use an account API token with <code>dns.write</code> to keep an A or AAAA record synchronized from a changing connection. The endpoint never accepts anonymous updates.</p><div class="dynamic-dns-example"><code>POST /external-api.php?resource=dynamic-dns</code><pre>{"domain":"example.com","name":"home","ip":"203.0.113.10","ttl":300}</pre></div><button type="button" class="ghost" data-cp-nav="api-tokens">Manage API tokens</button></article><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DNSSEC</span><h3>Zone signing & registrar DS record</h3></div><span id="cpDnssecBadge" class="status-pill">SELECT DOMAIN</span></div><label>Managed domain<select id="cpDnssecDomain" data-domain-source="existing-active"></select></label><div class="inline-actions"><button type="button" class="primary" id="cpDnssecEnable">Enable DNSSEC</button><button type="button" class="danger" id="cpDnssecDisable">Disable DNSSEC</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpDnssecRefresh">Refresh</button></div><p id="cpDnssecDetail" class="muted">Select a domain to inspect signing state.</p><pre id="cpDnssecDS" class="operation-output" hidden></pre></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="ssl"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY</span><h1>SSL/TLS</h1><p>Issue certificates, run AutoSSL and review active HTTPS certificates for your websites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-ssl-issue"><h3>Issue certificate</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><button class="primary">Issue certificate</button></form><form class="panel-card quick-form" id="cpAutoSSLForm"><h3>Run AutoSSL</h3><label>Website<select name="domain" id="cpAutoSSLDomain"><option value="">All active websites</option></select></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Run AutoSSL now</button><small>Privora checks DNS and automatically issues missing or expiring Let's Encrypt certificates.</small></form><article class="panel-card"><h3>AutoSSL results</h3><p class="muted" id="cpAutoSSLStatus">No AutoSSL scan has been run in this session.</p><div id="cpAutoSSLResults" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Run AutoSSL to see per-domain results.</div></div></article><article class="panel-card"><h3>Active certificates</h3><p class="muted"><span id="cpActiveCertificateCount">0</span> active certificate(s).</p><div id="cpSslTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="backups"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">FILES</span><h1>Backups 2.0</h1><p>Run, schedule and verify certified local backups for this hosting account.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-backup-create"><h3>Run backup now</h3><label>Scope<select name="scope"><option value="site">Site</option><option value="account">Account</option></select></label><label>Resource<select name="resource" id="cpBackupResource" required></select><small id="cpBackupResourceHint">Choose the website to back up.</small></label><input type="hidden" name="destination" value="local"><button class="primary">Create certified local backup</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpBackupsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div><div class="split-page v7-workbench"><form id="cpBackupPolicyForm" class="panel-card quick-form"><input type="hidden" name="id"><h3>Scheduled backup</h3><label>Scope<select name="scope"><option value="site">Site</option><option value="account">Account</option></select></label><label>Resource<select name="resource" id="cpBackupPolicyResource" required></select></label><label>Schedule<select name="schedule"><option value="hourly">Hourly</option><option value="daily" selected>Daily</option><option value="weekly">Weekly</option><option value="monthly">Monthly</option></select></label><label>Retention<input name="retention" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="14"></label><label class="check-line"><input name="verify" type="checkbox" checked> Verify each backup automatically</label><button class="primary">Save schedule</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Backup schedules</h3><small>Runs continue even while PPanel is closed</small></div><button id="cpRefreshBackupPolicies" class="ghost" type="button">Refresh</button></div><div id="cpBackupPoliciesTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading policies…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="sftp"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">FILES</span><h1>SFTP Accounts</h1><p>Secure file-transfer users jailed to this hosting account.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-sftp-create"><h3>Create SFTP user</h3><label>Username<input name="username" required placeholder="deploy"></label><label>Authentication<select name="auth"><option value="ssh-key">SSH key</option><option value="password">Password policy</option></select></label><button class="primary">Create SFTP account</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpSftpTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="apps"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>Applications & Runtime</h1><p>Review application tooling available on this server and manage deployment records for your hosting account.</p></div></div><div class="pp-runtime-overview"><article class="panel-card runtime-status-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">LARAVEL</span><h3>Laravel environment</h3></div><span class="badge warning" id="cpLaravelBadge">CHECKING</span></div><p id="cpLaravelDetail" class="muted">Checking the server for the Laravel development stack…</p><div id="cpLaravelPackages" class="runtime-package-list"></div><button class="ghost" type="button" data-cp-nav="app-installer">Open App Installer</button></article><article class="panel-card runtime-status-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SERVER RUNTIME</span><h3>Development tools</h3></div><span class="badge" id="cpRuntimeBadge">CHECKING</span></div><div id="cpRuntimeSnapshot" class="runtime-snapshot"><div class="empty">Loading runtime availability…</div></div><p class="form-note">Server packages are installed by the administrator in PCC. PPanel only uses tooling already available on the server.</p></article></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-application-create"><h3>Create deployment record</h3><label>Type<select name="type"><option value="laravel">Laravel</option><option value="wordpress">WordPress</option><option value="node">Node.js</option><option value="python">Python</option></select></label><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Runtime<input name="runtime" value="php8.4"></label><button class="primary">Create deployment</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><h3>Account deployments</h3><span class="badge">ACCOUNT SCOPED</span></div><div id="cpAppsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div><article class="panel-card v7-workbench"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">APPLICATION LIFECYCLE</span><h3>Detected live applications</h3></div><button class="ghost" id="cpRefreshAppLifecycle" type="button">Rescan</button></div><p class="muted">WordPress and Laravel maintenance commands are allow-listed and execute as your hosting account user.</p><div id="cpAppLifecycleTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Scanning websites…</div></div><pre id="cpAppLifecycleOutput" class="operation-output" hidden></pre></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="disk-usage"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">FILES & STORAGE</span><h1>Disk Usage</h1><p>Live storage consumption for this hosting account, measured from the account home directory.</p></div><button class="ghost" data-metrics-refresh>Refresh</button></div><div class="disk-usage-overview"><article class="panel-card disk-usage-primary"><span class="eyebrow">STORAGE</span><div class="disk-usage-number"><strong id="diskUsageBytes">—</strong><span id="diskUsageLimit">package limit loading…</span></div><progress id="diskUsageBar" max="100" value="0"></progress><p class="muted" id="diskUsageScan">Reading account storage…</p></article><article class="panel-card"><span class="eyebrow">FILESYSTEM INVENTORY</span><div class="disk-file-stats"><div><strong id="diskUsageFiles">—</strong><span>Files</span></div><div><strong id="diskUsageDirs">—</strong><span>Directories</span></div></div><button class="ghost" type="button" data-cp-nav="files">Open File Manager</button></article></div><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Storage management</h3><small>Account-scoped and symlink-safe</small></div></div><p class="muted">Use File Manager to remove unnecessary files or Backups to preserve a copy before cleanup. Privora does not expose server-wide paths to hosting users.</p><div class="cp-inline-actions"><button class="primary" type="button" data-cp-nav="files">Manage files</button><button class="ghost" type="button" data-cp-nav="backups">Create backup</button></div></article></section>
