<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="account-security"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCOUNT SECURITY</span><h1>Two-Factor Authentication</h1><p>Require a time-based authenticator code in addition to your panel password when you sign in.</p></div><span class="status-pill" id="cpMfaBadge">CHECKING</span></div><div class="settings-layout customer-settings"><article class="panel-card settings-card security-account-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Authenticator app</h3><small>TOTP · RFC-compatible authenticator apps</small></div></div><p class="muted" id="cpMfaStatus" aria-live="polite">Checking authenticator status…</p><div class="mfa-actions"><button class="primary" type="button" id="cpMfaBegin">Set up authenticator</button></div><div class="mfa-enrollment" id="cpMfaEnrollment" hidden><p>Add Privora Panel to your authenticator app with the setup secret or URI below, then enter the current code to finish enrollment.</p><label>Setup secret<input id="cpMfaSecret" readonly autocomplete="off"></label><label>Authenticator URI<textarea id="cpMfaUri" rows="3" readonly spellcheck="false"></textarea></label><form id="cpMfaConfirmForm" class="inline-security-form"><label>6-digit authenticator code<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="8" required></label><button class="primary" type="submit">Enable two-factor authentication</button></form></div><form id="cpMfaDisableForm" class="inline-security-form mfa-disable" hidden><p class="muted">Disabling 2FA requires both your current panel password and a current authenticator code.</p><label>Current panel password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><label>Authenticator code<input name="code" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" maxlength="8" required></label><button class="danger" type="submit">Disable two-factor authentication</button></form></article><article class="panel-card settings-card"><span class="eyebrow">SIGN-IN PROTECTION</span><h3>How Privora protects this account</h3><div class="preview-stack"><div><b>Account-scoped session</b><small>Hosting users cannot cross into PCC/root operations.</small></div><div><b>CSRF protection</b><small>State-changing panel requests require the active session token.</small></div><div><b>Authenticator verification</b><small>When enabled, a valid TOTP code is required at sign-in.</small></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="api-tokens"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">AUTOMATION SECURITY</span><h1>API Tokens</h1><p>Create account-scoped API credentials with explicit permissions, expiry and optional source-IP restrictions.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form id="cpApiTokenForm" class="panel-card quick-form"><h3>Issue token</h3><label>Name<input name="name" required placeholder="deployment-bot"></label><label>Scopes<select name="scopes" multiple size="8"><option value="health.read">Health read</option><option value="sites.read">Sites read</option><option value="resources.read">Resource usage read</option><option value="backups.read">Backups read</option><option value="backups.write">Backups write</option><option value="dns.read">DNS read</option><option value="dns.write">DNS write</option><option value="ssl.read">SSL read</option><option value="ssl.write">SSL write</option><option value="mail.read">Mail read</option><option value="mail.write">Mail write</option><option value="monitoring.read">Monitoring read</option><option value="databases.read">Databases read</option><option value="databases.write">Databases write</option></select></label><label>Allowed CIDRs<input name="allowed_cidrs" placeholder="Optional: 203.0.113.10/32"></label><label>Expires at<input name="expires_at" type="datetime-local"></label><button class="primary">Issue token</button><small>The full secret is shown once and cannot be recovered later.</small></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpApiTokensTable" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Loading API tokens…</div></div></article></div><article class="panel-card installer-credentials" id="cpApiTokenSecretCard" hidden><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAVE NOW</span><h3>API token secret</h3></div><span class="badge warning">SHOWN ONCE</span></div><pre id="cpApiTokenSecret"></pre><button class="ghost" type="button" data-copy-api-token="cpApiTokenSecret">Copy token</button></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="security"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY</span><h1>Security Center</h1><p>Account-level isolation, certificate coverage and access-control status.</p></div></div><div class="grid"><article class="panel-card"><h3>Account isolation</h3><p class="muted">Your session and API routes are scoped to this hosting account. Server/root operations remain unavailable.</p><div class="chip-row"><span class="security-chip">Scoped API</span><span class="security-chip">CSRF</span><span class="security-chip">Symlink-safe files</span><span class="security-chip">Session timeout</span></div></article><article class="panel-card"><h3>Certificates</h3><p class="muted"><span id="securitySslCount">0</span> managed certificate records are currently visible to this account.</p></article><article class="panel-card"><h3>Isolation policy</h3><div id="securityIsolationStatus" class="muted">Loading account isolation…</div></article><article class="panel-card"><h3>Access controls</h3><div id="securityControlStatus" class="muted">Loading IP blocks and SSH keys…</div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="cron"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>Cron Jobs</h1><p>Schedule commands for your hosting account. Production host execution remains gated until the Linux adapter is certified.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-cron-create"><h3>Add cron job</h3><label>Schedule<input name="schedule" required value="*/5 * * * *"></label><label>Command<input name="command" required value="php artisan schedule:run"></label><button class="primary">Create cron job</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpCronTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="deploy"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>Git & Application Deployment</h1><p>Create validated Laravel, WordPress, Node.js, Python or Git deployment intents for your sites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-deployment-create"><h3>Create deployment</h3><label>Kind<select name="kind"><option>git</option><option>laravel</option><option>wordpress</option><option>node</option><option>python</option></select></label><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Repository<input name="repository" value="https://github.com/example/app.git"></label><label>Branch<input name="branch" value="main"></label><label>Runtime<input name="runtime" value="php8.4"></label><button class="primary">Create deployment</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpDeployTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="forwarders">
  <div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Forwarders</h1><p>Keep routing simple: review active forwarders first and open the form only when adding one.</p></div></div>
  <details class="panel-card mail-compose customer-mail-compose"><summary><span>+ Create forwarder</span><small>Open routing form</small></summary><form class="quick-form mail-compose-form" id="cpAliasCreateForm" data-customer-create="customer-mail-alias-create"><label>Forwarder address<div class="mail-address-builder"><input name="local_part" required maxlength="64" autocomplete="off" placeholder="sales" aria-label="Forwarder name"><span>@</span><select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required aria-label="Forwarder domain"></select></div><small>Choose from domains already created in this hosting account.</small></label><label>Deliver to<input name="destination" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="owner@example.net"></label><div class="mail-form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Create forwarder</button></div></form></details>
  <article class="panel-card mail-list-card mail-primary-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Active forwarders</h3><small>Edit the destination or delete a forwarder.</small></div><span class="badge">POSTFIX</span></div><div id="cpAliasesTable" class="data-table"></div></article>
</section><section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="webmail"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Webmail</h1><p>Open your mailbox through the server webmail client when the administrator has installed and certified it.</p></div><span class="badge" id="cpWebmailBadge">CHECKING</span></div><div class="split-page"><article class="panel-card runtime-status-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Webmail gateway</h3><small>Account-safe launch</small></div><span class="status-pill sim" id="cpWebmailGatewayState">CHECKING</span></div><p id="cpWebmailStatus" class="muted">Checking this server for Roundcube, SnappyMail or RainLoop…</p><a class="primary webmail-launch" id="cpWebmailLaunch" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open Webmail</a><div class="runtime-admin-note" id="cpWebmailAdminHint" hidden><b>Administrator setup required</b><span>Ask the server administrator to install or repair Roundcube from PCC → Mail or PCC → Extensions & Components.</span></div><p class="form-note">Privora never stores your mailbox password in panel state. Authentication happens in the webmail client itself.</p></article><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><h3>Integration status</h3><span class="badge">SERVER CHECK</span></div><div id="cpWebmailDetails" class="data-table"><div class="empty">Checking…</div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="mail-domain"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Email Routing, IMAP & Authentication</h1><p>Configure incoming IMAP access, secure mail.domain.com service, TLS, DKIM, SPF, DMARC and webmail for your domain.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-mail-domain-create" id="cpImapSetupForm"><span class="eyebrow">INCOMING MAIL</span><h3>Configure / Repair IMAP</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" id="cpImapDomainSelect" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>DMARC<select name="dmarc"><option>quarantine</option><option>reject</option><option>none</option></select></label><div class="imap-settings-grid"><div><span>Incoming server</span><strong id="cpImapIncomingHost">mail.your-domain</strong></div><div><span>IMAP</span><strong>993 · SSL/TLS</strong></div><div><span>Username</span><strong>Full email address</strong></div><div><span>Legacy IMAP</span><strong>143 disabled</strong></div></div><button class="primary">Configure / Repair IMAP</button><p class="form-note">This repairs the secure mail service for the domain. Existing mailbox data is not deleted.</p></form><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Mail domain status</h3><small>IMAP/TLS and sender authentication</small></div><span class="status-pill" id="cpImapServiceBadge">CHECKING</span></div><div id="cpImapServiceStatus" class="imap-service-status muted">Checking Dovecot capability…</div><div id="cpMailDomainsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="staging"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>Staging Environments</h1><p>Create a safe staging intent tied to one of your production sites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-staging-create"><h3>Create staging site</h3><label>Production domain<input name="production_domain" required></label><label>Staging domain<input name="staging_domain" required placeholder="staging.example.com"></label><button class="primary">Create staging</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpStagingTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>

<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="app-installer"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>Application Installer</h1><p>Install curated applications from Privora-signed release manifests into one of your websites.</p></div><span class="badge online">SIGNED SOURCES</span></div><div class="installer-layout"><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">CATALOG</span><h3>One-click applications</h3></div><input id="installerSearch" class="catalog-search" placeholder="Search WordPress, Joomla, Drupal…"></div><div id="cpInstallerCatalog" class="installer-grid"></div></article><form class="panel-card quick-form installer-form" id="cpInstallerForm" data-customer-create="customer-app-install"><span class="eyebrow">INSTALL</span><h3>Install application</h3><label>Application<select name="template" id="cpInstallerTemplate" required></select></label><label>Domain<select name="domain" id="cpInstallerDomain" required></select></label><label>Install path<input name="path" value="." placeholder=". or blog"></label><label>Database<select name="database" id="cpInstallerDatabase"><option value="">Use app default</option><option value="mysql">MySQL</option><option value="mariadb">MariaDB</option><option value="postgresql">PostgreSQL</option></select></label><label>Site title<input name="site_title" placeholder="My Website"></label><label>Administrator username<input name="admin_user" value="admin" autocomplete="username"></label><label>Administrator email<input name="admin_email" type="email" placeholder="admin@example.com"></label><label>Administrator password<input name="admin_password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to generate"></label><button class="primary">Install application</button><p class="form-note">Privora verifies its signed app manifest, HTTPS source, SHA-256 and archive safety before publishing. Generated credentials are shown once and are not stored in panel history.</p></form></div><article class="panel-card installer-credentials" id="cpInstallCredentials" hidden><div class="card-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">SAVE NOW</span><h3>Generated credentials</h3></div><span class="badge warning">SHOWN ONCE</span></div><pre id="cpInstallCredentialsText"></pre></article><article class="panel-card installer-history"><div class="card-head"><h3>Install history</h3><span class="badge online">SIGNED / ROLLBACK AWARE</span></div><div id="cpInstallsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="redirects"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>Redirects</h1><p>Create account-scoped redirect policies for your sites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="redirect"><h3>Add redirect</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Source path<input name="name" value="/old-page" required></label><label>Target URL/path<input name="value" value="/new-page" required></label><button class="primary">Save redirect</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpRedirectsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="error-pages"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>Error Pages</h1><p>Map HTTP errors to custom pages inside your site.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="error_page"><h3>Custom error page</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Status code<select name="name"><option>404</option><option>403</option><option>410</option><option>429</option><option>500</option><option>502</option><option>503</option></select></label><label>Page path<input name="value" value="/errors/404.html" required></label><button class="primary">Save mapping</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpErrorPagesTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="mime-types"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>MIME Types</h1><p>Add account-level file-extension MIME mappings.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="mime_type"><h3>Add MIME mapping</h3><label>Extension<input name="name" value="webmanifest" required></label><label>MIME type<input name="value" value="application/manifest+json" required></label><button class="primary">Save MIME type</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpMimeTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="directory-privacy"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">FILES</span><h1>Directory Privacy</h1><p>Record privacy policy for paths inside your sites.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="directory_privacy"><h3>Protect directory</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Relative directory<input name="name" value="private" required></label><label>Policy<select name="value"><option value="enabled">Protected</option><option value="disabled">Public</option></select></label><button class="primary">Save policy</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpPrivacyTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="hotlink"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAINS</span><h1>Hotlink Protection</h1><p>Prevent external sites from embedding your image assets.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="hotlink"><input type="hidden" name="name" value="images"><h3>Image hotlink policy</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Policy<select name="value"><option value="enabled">Enabled</option><option value="disabled">Disabled</option></select></label><button class="primary">Save policy</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpHotlinkTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="autoresponders"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Autoresponders</h1><p>Configure automatic replies for addresses on your domains.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="autoresponder"><h3>Add autoresponder</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Email address<input name="name" placeholder="support@example.com" required></label><label>Reply message<textarea name="value" rows="6" required>Thanks for contacting us. We will reply soon.</textarea></label><button class="primary">Save autoresponder</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpAutorespondersTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="spam"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL</span><h1>Spam Filters</h1><p>Choose per-domain spam sensitivity and delivery action.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="spam_policy"><h3>Spam policy</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Sensitivity<select name="name"><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="aggressive">Aggressive</option><option value="lenient">Lenient</option><option value="disabled">Disabled</option></select></label><label>Action<select name="value"><option value="quarantine">Quarantine</option><option value="reject">Reject</option><option value="deliver">Deliver with score</option></select></label><button class="primary">Save spam policy</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpSpamTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="php-options"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>PHP Options</h1><p>Set validated per-site PHP limits and runtime options.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="php_setting"><h3>PHP setting</h3><label>Domain<select name="domain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select></label><label>Setting<select name="name"><option>memory_limit</option><option>upload_max_filesize</option><option>post_max_size</option><option>max_execution_time</option><option>max_input_vars</option><option>display_errors</option><option>opcache.enable</option></select></label><label>Value<select name="value" id="cpPhpSettingValue" required></select><small id="cpPhpSettingValueHint">Choose a validated value for this PHP setting.</small></label><button class="primary">Save option</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpPhpOptionsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="php-extensions"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE</span><h1>PHP Extensions</h1><p>Search server PHP modules, see what is installed, and control extension policy for one of your websites.</p></div><span class="badge" id="cpExtensionCount">0 MODULES</span></div><article class="panel-card ppanel-extension-toolbar"><div class="field-grid"><label>Website<select id="cpExtensionDomain" data-domain-source="existing-active" required></select><small>Extension policy is saved for this website only.</small></label><label>Search extensions<input id="cpExtensionSearch" type="search" placeholder="Search PDO, SQLite, Imagick, Redis, ZIP…" autocomplete="off"><small>Searches friendly names, module names, packages and tags.</small></label></div><div class="runtime-filter-row"><button type="button" class="runtime-filter active" data-extension-filter="all">All</button><button type="button" class="runtime-filter" data-extension-filter="installed">Installed</button><button type="button" class="runtime-filter" data-extension-filter="available">Available</button><button type="button" class="runtime-filter" data-extension-filter="missing">Needs admin</button></div></article><div class="pp-runtime-summary" id="cpExtensionSummary"></div><div id="cpExtensionCatalog" class="pp-component-grid"><div class="empty">Loading PHP extension inventory…</div></div><article class="panel-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Saved site policies</h3><small>Policies recorded for websites in this hosting account</small></div><span class="badge">ACCOUNT SCOPED</span></div><div id="cpPhpExtensionsTable" class="data-table"></div></article></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="ip-blocker"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY</span><h1>IP Blocker</h1><p>Block an IP address or CIDR from account-owned web resources.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="ip_block"><input type="hidden" name="value" value="blocked"><h3>Block source</h3><label>IP or CIDR<input name="name" value="203.0.113.0/24" required></label><button class="primary">Add block</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpIpBlocksTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="ssh-keys"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">SECURITY</span><h1>SSH Keys</h1><p>Store public-key access policy for this hosting account. Private keys are never accepted.</p></div></div><div class="split-page"><form class="panel-card quick-form" data-customer-create="customer-control-create"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="ssh_key"><h3>Add public key</h3><label>Label<input name="name" value="laptop" required></label><label>Public key<textarea name="value" rows="6" placeholder="ssh-ed25519 AAAA… user@example" required></textarea></label><button class="primary">Add key</button></form><article class="panel-card"><div id="cpSshKeysTable" class="data-table"></div></article></div></section>
<section class="cp-view" data-cp-view="preferences"><div class="cp-page-head"><button class="cp-back" data-cp-nav="home">← All tools</button><div><span class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE</span><h1>Panel Preferences</h1><p>Choose how this hosting panel looks and how densely information is displayed on this browser.</p></div></div><div class="settings-layout customer-settings"><article class="panel-card settings-card"><form id="customerPreferencesForm" class="settings-form"><div class="setting-row"><div><b>Color theme</b><small>Light, dark or follow your device.</small></div><select name="theme"><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option><option value="system">Follow system</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><b>Interface density</b><small>Adjust spacing across tools and data tables.</small></div><select name="density"><option value="comfortable">Comfortable</option><option value="compact">Compact</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><b>Tool groups</b><small>Choose how category groups appear on the home screen.</small></div><select name="groups"><option value="expanded">Expanded</option><option value="collapsed">Collapsed</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><b>Table spacing</b><small>Show more rows at once when managing larger sites.</small></div><select name="table_density"><option value="standard">Standard</option><option value="compact">Compact</option></select></div><div class="setting-row"><div><b>Motion</b><small>Reduce transitions when desired.</small></div><select name="motion"><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="reduced">Reduced</option></select></div><div class="settings-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">Save preferences</button><button class="ghost" type="button" id="resetCustomerPreferences">Reset defaults</button></div></form></article></div></section>
