<div class="modal" id="cpSiteEditModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form" id="cpSiteEditForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE SETTINGS</span><h2 id="cpSiteEditTitle">Edit Website</h2><p>Manage the safe settings for this website.</p></div><span class="status-pill" id="cpSiteEditStatus">Checking</span></div><input type="hidden" name="domain" id="cpSiteEditDomain"><section class="form-section"><div class="field-grid"><label>Domain<input id="cpSiteEditDomainDisplay" readonly></label><label>Document root<input id="cpSiteEditRoot" readonly></label><label>PHP runtime<select name="version" id="cpSiteEditPhp"></select></label></div></section><section class="form-section form-section-soft"><div class="provision-summary"><div><span>DNS</span><b id="cpSiteEditDNS">—</b></div><div><span>SSL</span><b id="cpSiteEditSSL">—</b></div><div><span>Type</span><b id="cpSiteEditKind">Website</b></div><div><span>Status</span><b id="cpSiteEditDetection">—</b></div></div></section><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpSiteEditOpen">Open website</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpSiteEditDNSOpen">DNS</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpSiteEditAutoSSL">Run AutoSSL</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save settings</button></div></form></div><div class="modal" id="cpSiteModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form" id="cpSiteForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DOMAIN & WEBSITE</span><h2>Create Website</h2><p>Create a new website under this hosting account with safe automatic web-server and DNS defaults.</p></div><span class="status-pill active">GUIDED SETUP</span></div><section class="form-section"><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-badge">1</span><div><h3>Website identity</h3><p>Enter the domain visitors will use.</p></div></div><label>Domain name<input name="domain" id="cpSiteDomain" required autocomplete="off" placeholder="shop.example.com"><small>For a child hostname of an existing site, use Add subdomain.</small></label></section><section class="form-section"><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-badge">2</span><div><h3>PHP runtime</h3><p>Select the runtime used by this website.</p></div></div><label>PHP version<select name="php_version" id="cpSitePhpVersion"><option>8.5</option><option selected>8.4</option><option>8.3</option><option>8.2</option></select></label></section><section class="form-section form-section-soft"><div class="form-section-head"><span class="step-badge">3</span><div><h3>Automatic provisioning</h3><p>Privora handles the repetitive server configuration for you.</p></div></div><div class="provision-summary"><div><span>Hosting account</span><b>Current account</b></div><div><span>Web server</span><b>Managed Nginx vhost</b></div><div><span>DNS</span><b>Managed when the zone is local</b></div><div><span>SSL</span><b>AutoSSL eligible after DNS resolves</b></div></div></section><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost modal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Create website</button></div></form></div>
<div class="modal" id="cpSubdomainModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card" id="cpSubdomainForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><span class="eyebrow">ADD SUBDOMAIN</span><h2>Create subdomain</h2><p class="muted">Choose one of your existing websites as the parent. Privora creates the web vhost and updates its managed DNS zone when possible. You can use a dedicated document root or share the parent website root.</p><label>Subdomain name<div class="subdomain-builder"><input name="label" id="cpSubdomainLabel" required autocomplete="off" inputmode="url" maxlength="63" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9](?:[A-Za-z0-9-]{0,61}[A-Za-z0-9])?" placeholder="blog" aria-label="Subdomain name"><span class="subdomain-dot" aria-hidden="true">.</span><select name="parent_domain" id="cpSubdomainParent" required aria-label="Existing domain"></select></div><small>Enter only the subdomain name. Choose one of your existing domains.</small></label><div class="subdomain-preview">Will create: <b id="cpSubdomainPreview">—</b></div><label>Document root<input name="document_root" id="cpSubdomainDocumentRoot" required autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="512" placeholder="/home/account/domains/blog.example.com/public"><small id="cpSubdomainRootHint">Privora fills the dedicated default root automatically. You can change it or point this subdomain at the parent website root.</small></label><div class="subdomain-root-actions"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpSubdomainUseDefaultRoot">Use default root</button><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpSubdomainUseParentRoot">Use parent domain root</button></div><label>PHP version<select name="php_version"><option>8.5</option><option selected>8.4</option><option>8.3</option><option>8.2</option></select></label><button class="primary">Create subdomain</button></form></div>
<div class="modal" id="cpDatabaseEditModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form" id="cpDatabaseEditForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATABASE ACCESS</span><h2>Edit database access</h2><p>Change the database username and/or set a new password. The database name itself remains unchanged.</p></div><span class="status-pill active">ACCOUNT OWNED</span></div><section class="form-section"><input type="hidden" name="name"><div class="field-grid"><label>Database<input name="database_display" readonly></label><label>Engine<input name="engine_display" readonly></label><label>Database user<input name="user" required autocomplete="username"></label><label>New password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to generate if user changes"></label><label>Confirm password<input name="password_confirm" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label></div><button type="button" class="ghost" data-db-generate="customer-edit">Generate password</button></section><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost modal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save database access</button></div></form></div><div class="modal" id="fmEditorModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form" id="fmEditorForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">FILE MANAGER</span><h2 id="fmEditorTitle">Edit file</h2><p>Text editor is limited to regular files up to 4 MiB.</p></div><span class="status-pill active" id="fmEditorStatus">ACCOUNT SCOPED</span></div><section class="form-section"><label>Relative path<input id="fmEditorPath" name="path" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>Contents<textarea id="fmEditorContent" name="content" rows="22" spellcheck="false"></textarea></label></section><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost modal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save file</button></div></form></div>
<div class="modal" id="cpMailboxEditModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form" id="cpMailboxEditForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">EMAIL ACCOUNT</span><h2>Edit mailbox</h2><p>Change the quota and optionally set a new password. The email address and existing Maildir stay unchanged.</p></div><span class="status-pill active">LIVE MAILBOX</span></div><section class="form-section"><input type="hidden" name="address"><div class="field-grid"><label>Email address<input name="address_display" readonly></label><label>Quota (MB)<input name="quota_mb" type="number" min="100" max="102400" required></label><label>New password<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Leave blank to keep current password"></label><label>Confirm new password<input name="password_confirm" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label></div><button type="button" class="ghost" data-mail-password-generate="customer-edit">Generate strong password</button></section><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost modal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save email account</button></div></form></div><div class="modal" id="cpAliasEditModal" aria-hidden="true"><form class="modal-card professional-form" id="cpAliasEditForm"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><span class="eyebrow">FORWARDER</span><h2>Edit forwarder</h2><p class="muted">Change where incoming mail is delivered. The forwarder address stays the same.</p><input type="hidden" name="address"><label>Forwarder address<input name="address_display" readonly></label><label>Deliver to<input name="destination" type="email" required></label><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost modal-cancel">Cancel</button><button class="primary" type="submit">Save forwarder</button></div></form></div><div class="modal" id="cpMailDomainManageModal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-card modal-card-wide professional-form"><button type="button" class="modal-close">×</button><div class="form-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">MAIL ACCOUNT SETTINGS</span><h2 id="cpMailDomainManageTitle">Mail client setup</h2><p>These settings are read from the live server configuration for this domain.</p></div><span class="status-pill" id="cpMailDomainManageBadge">CHECKING</span></div><div id="cpMailDomainManageStatus" class="mail-domain-live-status muted">Reading live mail configuration…</div><div id="cpMailDomainManageServices" class="mail-client-services"></div><article class="mail-client-copy-card"><div class="card-head"><div><h3>Setup instructions</h3><small>Use the full mailbox address and that mailbox's password.</small></div><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpMailDomainConfigCopy">Copy settings</button></div><pre id="cpMailDomainConfigText"></pre></article><div class="form-footer"><button type="button" class="ghost" id="cpMailDomainConfigRefresh">Refresh from server</button><button type="button" class="primary modal-close">Done</button></div></div></div><div id="toast" class="toast"></div><script src="/assets/customer.js?v=<?=$privoraAssetVersion?>"></script><script src="/assets/v7-customer.js?v=<?=$privoraAssetVersion?>"></script></body></html>
